flowchart LR
  U[Researcher browser] --> UI[React + TypeScript + Vite<br/>Responsive evidence-first workspace]
  UI -->|tRPC / validated inputs| API[Express + tRPC API<br/>OAuth session · role checks]
  API --> SVC[Domain services<br/>Search · entity resolution<br/>CSV import · event studies]
  SVC --> DB[(Managed MySQL-compatible DB<br/>Drizzle models + migrations)]
  SVC --> FX[Idempotent synthetic fixtures<br/>Explicit demo provenance]

  ADMIN[Authenticated admin<br/>DB target + current feed access confirmations] -->|Admin-only configure / run / export| API
  FLAG[Server-only GOVMARKET_PIB_WRITE_TARGET=development<br/>unset by default] -->|required before database writes| API
  PIB[Official PIB RSS directory link<br/>Fixed press-release feed URL] --> AD[server/pibRss.ts<br/>HTTPS · bounded XML parser · retries]
  API -->|manual request only| AD
  AD --> DOC[Source documents + retained revisions<br/>URL · GUID if supplied · hashes · fetched time]
  DOC --> EVT[Unverified press-release candidates<br/>No inferred company/official edges]
  DOC --> JOB[Source job + audit metrics<br/>Rows · duplicates · errors · retries]
  DOC --> DB
  EVT --> DB
  JOB --> DB
  API -->|Admin CSV export| CSV[Browser download + git-ignored<br/>data/export/*.csv]
  DB --> UI

  CORP[Corporate disclosures] -. future, only when permitted .-> SVC
  MKT[Licensed market data] -. future, only when licensed .-> SVC
  SOC[Supported official social APIs] -. future, only when permitted .-> SVC
